     /// The map drives on the left (`global.cfg` `[lht]`): priority to the left, the
     /// oncoming lane on the right, turning right across the oncoming traffic.
     pub left_hand: bool,
+    /// Between paths of equal rank that cross (no `[rule] priority`, no ring, no turn across the
+    /// oncoming traffic) the one coming from the right goes first (StVO §8; from the left on a
+    /// left-hand map). Off by default: Omsi.exe has no such rule (first come, first served,
+    /// #2058); the map editor's traffic turns it on, where cars standing at every approach of
+    /// an unsigned crossing could not settle who goes.
+    pub right_before_left: bool,
 }
 
